          <td>42 0/7 and beyond</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p><em>Source: ACOG Committee Opinion, Definition of Term Pregnancy.</em></p>

    <h2>When to Call Your Clinician</h2>

    <p>Contact your healthcare provider if:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>You are unsure of your due date</li>
      <li>Your due date has changed</li>
      <li>You are past your due date</li>
      <li>You have signs of labor before 37 weeks</li>
    </ul>

